    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Map and Wireframe Your Site\r\n\r\n## Do This:\r\n\r\n* Plan at least 3–4 pages (e.g., Home, Article, Image Gallery, Join).\r\n\r\n* Sketch the basic layout using the wireframe assets for your pages.\r\n\r\n* Add your sketch to your **Backpack** to use in the next level.\r\n\r\n**What should I include?**\r\n\r\nWireframe assets such as images, placeholders, and structure (ignore styling and colors for now)",
